  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring Access to Compulsory Education for Rural Migrant Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed IDF grant will contribute to enhancing MOE&apos;s administrative &amp; regulatory capacity, and M&amp;E capacity to better serving the rural migrants&apos; children. With the grant, MOE will: (1) produce baseline data on migrant children through a needs assessment; (2) assess current policies and regulations at national and local levels so as to provide guidance for preparation of new regulations; (3) build capacity of those working to serve target population; (4) support pilots to promote affordable and quality compulsory education for rural migrant children; (5) support the review and improvement of government efforts in the use of a tracking system for migrant children.</narrative>
  </description>
